  (descr "Cherry MX style mechanical keyboard switch, Kailh/Gateron hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, double-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.2=14.00mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (MX / MX Low Profile / Gateron Low Profile). Keycap: 4.50u (courtyard 85.68x19.00mm). No stabilizer PCB features. Plate-mount MX stabilizers can be used.")
